<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 3.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 3.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95     99/100     UNQ     200/205</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/97    102/103   195/200   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices were slightly lower on Thursday following weak crude values and softer cargo prices, traders said. Talks were thin but some suppliers said the low level of Singapore's weekly residual fuel oil stocks should support sentiment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
